# Sources diff as text, always.
#
# Git decides binary-ness by looking for a NUL byte in either side of a diff,
# and one test file carried a real NUL inside a string literal — the DOS "MZ"
# header it feeds the upload route to prove sharp refuses it. The literal is
# written with escapes now, but the blob already in history still holds the
# byte, so without this the whole file renders as "Bin 6755 -> 12289 bytes"
# and a reviewable change is hidden behind it.
*.ts diff
*.tsx diff
*.css diff
*.md diff
*.json diff
